{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n在今晚（20日）播出的TVB節目《玫瑰戰爭》中，鄺潔楹（Judy）飾演的安安將有生死一線的遭遇！因手握關鍵證物而招來殺身之禍，慘遭汽車撞飛滅口。劇組率先公開這場驚險戲份的幕後花絮，原來畫面上「衝力十足」的撞擊效果，全靠Judy親身上陣完成，過程絕對考驗體能！\n</p>\n<h2>今晚劇情：安安反口加價惹殺機 慘遭撞飛滅口</h2>\n<p>在今晚播出的第九集「致命證物」中，安安（鄺潔楹飾）因手上握有涉及子盈（陳自瑤飾）死亡真相的關鍵USB，加上平時口沒遮攔的性格早已惹來生哥（陳豪飾）不滿。黎綺雲（林夏薇飾）為討好生哥，以20萬高價向安安收購USB，沒想到在交易之際，安安竟突然反口加價，最終招來殺身之禍，被汽車撞飛滅口，情況危殆，劇情相當緊湊！</p>\n<h2>撞車戲幕後花絮曝光 鄺潔楹親自發力衝向車頭</h2>\n<p>雖然劇中被撞飛的鏡頭只有一瞬間，但整個拍攝過程卻非常認真講究。劇組今日公開的幕後花絮可見，在拍攝所有動作場口前，導演及武術指導都會貼身為鄺潔楹講解及示範。現場除了鋪設好安全軟墊，工作人員亦全程緊盯，一有需要便立即衝前扶實Judy，確保萬無一失。雖然鏡頭前效果逼真，但拍攝過程絕對安全。</p>\n<h2>鄺潔楹腰力腳力大爆發 營造「衝力十足」效果</h2>\n<p>最令人驚訝的是，鏡頭所見Judy被撞飛時的「衝力十足」效果，其實全都是靠她自己發力完成。從花絮片段可見，Judy先是親自發力衝向車頭，之後再竭盡全力向後倒，以營造出被巨大力量撞飛的逼真效果。要完美做出這個動作，可見Judy的腰力、腳力及爆發力均相當不俗，身手令人刮目相看，非常敬業。</p>\n<h2>網民期待今晚驚險場面：Judy太搏命！</h2>\n<p>花絮曝光後，不少網民都對鄺潔楹的搏命演出表示佩服，並對今晚的劇情大感期待。網民紛紛留言：「今晚一定要睇！想睇安安點樣大難不死！」、「Judy真係好敬業，咁危險嘅場面都親身上陣！」、「睇花絮都覺得牙煙，佩服佢嘅勇氣！」、「原來撞車戲係咁拍，長知識了！」、「TVB啲演員真係搏命，為咗效果可以去到好盡！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_2449084926b001aa521375.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_2449084926b001aa521375.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_5006778136b001aac2f410.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_5006778136b001aac2f410.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/31a_10697516986b001b08c9b9b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/31a_10697516986b001b08c9b9b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/35_21460853596b001b2f40621.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/35_21460853596b001b2f40621.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36_8573702286b001b335032a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36_8573702286b001b335032a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37_5274291076b001b3735595.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/37_5274291076b001b3735595.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/38_2945447756b001b3ae7d76.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/38_2945447756b001b3ae7d76.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/39_15502118366b001b3f3461e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/39_15502118366b001b3f3461e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:02.027095+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1108,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T10:55:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T11:37:24.763685+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:25.864635+00:00","content_hash":"04d7ac9c64c97c32f3d0dbd2f20ea379e8c97bfc9f98ad177d5912fc96d56805","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}